[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on a lift\nand raise it.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891740\">4450B11</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Using the tool (1a), remove the front hub cover (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.847.014.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035111.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>Remove the hub cover from the\ntool.</p>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit the hub cover using the tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Drift</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.875.059.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035112.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2891740\">4450B11</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Lower the car and remove it from the ramp.</p>"]]